# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command passwd
usage 1   passwd <newpassword>          change your own password
usage 2   passwd <name> <newpassword>   change <name>'s password (root only)

case passwords
target none
covers 1-2
$ passwd
out 65
passwd: usage: passwd <newpassword> | passwd <name> <newpassword>
status 1
action none
$ passwd newpass
out 28
Password updated for 'root'.
status 0
action none
$ useradd tester
out 20
Added user 'tester'.
status 0
action none
$ passwd tester secret
out 30
Password updated for 'tester'.
status 0
action none
$ passwd nosuch secret
out 30
passwd: no such user 'nosuch'.
status 1
action none
$ su tester
out 21
Switched to 'tester'.
status 0
action none
$ passwd root x
out 53
passwd: only root can change another user's password.
status 1
action none
$ passwd mine
out 30
Password updated for 'tester'.
status 0
action none
$ passwd a b c
out 65
passwd: usage: passwd <newpassword> | passwd <name> <newpassword>
status 1
action none
end
